 \n636:         <div class=\"matrioshka-diagram-box\">\n637:           <div style=\"font-size:11.5px; font-weight:800; color:#E7C878;\">3. Bucle de Fricción Logística (Inter-Local Loop)</div>\n638:           <div style=\"font-size:10.5px; color:#cbd5e1; line-height:1.45;\">\n639:             Demanda Insumos Zona Franca <b>[B1]</b> ⇄ Flujo Carga ⇄ Redistribución en Kennedy <b>[D1]</b>. La falta de un corredor segregado hace competir tractocamiones con el transporte masivo urbano.\n640:           </div>\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
